WEBVTT

00:00:59.347 --> 00:01:03.643
So when it comes to sex, why isn't it
one of the first ones that we reach for?

00:01:05.269 --> 00:01:08.022
When I first started doing research
on arousal and desire,

00:01:08.022 --> 00:01:12.110
I learned that for women,
cognition is as important to arousal

00:01:12.110 --> 00:01:14.153
as the presence of sexual stimuli.

00:01:15.029 --> 00:01:20.409
In other words, using their memories,
fantasies and some focus,

00:01:21.202 --> 00:01:23.538
women can turn themselves on
with their thoughts.

00:01:25.248 --> 00:01:27.458
This particular study focused on women,

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:31.504
and much of my own work is also focused
on people who are female identifying.